    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is an action puzzle game about camera magic</h2><br>In the game, players will play as Miss Talia, a graduate student of the Magic Academy, racing against time!<br>Will you be able to return to the academy before the dorm lights go out? That\u2019s up to you!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Time-Space Magic of the Camera!</h2><br><strong>Copy Space!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949740/extras/05fa1d3c5319aa0c3e42dd64599f24a1.poster.avif?t=1720537653\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949740/extras/05fa1d3c5319aa0c3e42dd64599f24a1.webm?t=1720537653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949740/extras/05fa1d3c5319aa0c3e42dd64599f24a1.mp4?t=1720537653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>By photographing close-up objects, create new platforms to keep moving forward!<br><br><strong>Return to the Past!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949740/extras/0cf8376e8ad07dc662ec9ffd3c8012cb.poster.avif?t=1720537653\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949740/extras/0cf8376e8ad07dc662ec9ffd3c8012cb.webm?t=1720537653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949740/extras/0cf8376e8ad07dc662ec9ffd3c8012cb.mp4?t=1720537653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>If you make a mistake in your shot, you can use time magic to return to the moment before the shot!<br><br><strong>Three Hidden Completion Rewards!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949740/extras/7f896447076cc8b8bd6a62151870856f.avif?t=1720537653\" width=480 height=270 /></span><br><br><strong>Some Unimportant Words:</strong><br>This game was my graduation project made during my study in Tokyo.<br>Because it\u2019s an individual production... there are probably still many points that need optimization and bugs.<br>Now that I'm a working adult, updates may be slow, but I will do my best to fix them!<br>Lastly, I hope you enjoy this roughly 10-minute gaming experience!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is an action puzzle game about camera magic</h2><br>In the game, players will play as Miss Talia, a graduate student of the Magic Academy, racing against time!<br>Will you be able to return to the academy before the dorm lights go out? That\u2019s up to you!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Time-Space Magic of the Camera!</h2><br><strong>Copy Space!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949740/extras/05fa1d3c5319aa0c3e42dd64599f24a1.poster.avif?t=1720537653\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949740/extras/05fa1d3c5319aa0c3e42dd64599f24a1.webm?t=1720537653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949740/extras/05fa1d3c5319aa0c3e42dd64599f24a1.mp4?t=1720537653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>By photographing close-up objects, create new platforms to keep moving forward!<br><br><strong>Return to the Past!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949740/extras/0cf8376e8ad07dc662ec9ffd3c8012cb.poster.avif?t=1720537653\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949740/extras/0cf8376e8ad07dc662ec9ffd3c8012cb.webm?t=1720537653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949740/extras/0cf8376e8ad07dc662ec9ffd3c8012cb.mp4?t=1720537653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>If you make a mistake in your shot, you can use time magic to return to the moment before the shot!<br><br><strong>Three Hidden Completion Rewards!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949740/extras/7f896447076cc8b8bd6a62151870856f.avif?t=1720537653\" width=480 height=270 /></span><br><br><strong>Some Unimportant Words:</strong><br>This game was my graduation project made during my study in Tokyo.<br>Because it\u2019s an individual production... there are probably still many points that need optimization and bugs.<br>Now that I'm a working adult, updates may be slow, but I will do my best to fix them!<br>Lastly, I hope you enjoy this roughly 10-minute gaming experience!",
    "short_description": "Lens Adventure is an action puzzle game where you play as Talia, a Magic Academy graduate student. Use the camera's time-space magic to solve puzzles: create platforms by photographing objects and use time magic to undo mistakes. Can you return to the academy before the dorm lights go out?",
